/-!
# Candidate words for absolute maximality of Held max5

The 34 representatives are literal words in Held.a and Held.b. The 4,831
rows select a representative and a positive word in the two max5 generators.
No group-theoretic assertion is made by these data. CoverChecks requests
the exact commutation equations that make the proposed left factors lie
in max5. RecoveryChecks requests the remaining 33 generator recoveries.

The source generator and untrusted search output are retained in source/.
The actual consumer is ConcreteMaximality.max5_isCoatom_of_checks.
Source context: ATLAS HeG1-max5W1; Aschbacher–Smith E.1.14(4), p.214.
-/

